      "content": "i hear you but he's totally fine if i wake him up for a minute, he just wants to go right back to sleep. it seems like too much for just diarrhea. if i do try the Pedialyte, how much should i actually give him? like how many ounces should i aim for every hour to make sure he's okay without me having to go in?",
